{"id":"dreimal","lemma":"dreimal","pos":"adv","rank":2299,"glosses":["thrice, three times"],"ipa":"/ˈdraɪ̯maːl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e6/De-at-dreimal.ogg/De-at-dreimal.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Dreimal drei sind neun.","en":"Three times three is nine.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/700243","words":[null,{"g":"three (numerical value…"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"nine"}]},{"text":"Wir haben dreimal in Folge verloren.","en":"We lost three times in a row.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"sequence"},{"g":"lost, missing"}]},{"text":"Er verdient dreimal mehr als ich.","en":"He earns three times more than me.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"deserved"},null,{"g":"more"},{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"I"}]},{"text":"Nehmen Sie diese Medizin dreimal täglich.","en":"Take this medicine three times a day.","words":[{"g":"to take"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"medicine (the study of…"},null,{"g":"every day, quotidianly"}]},{"text":"Dreimal dürfen Sie raten.","en":"You have three guesses.","words":[null,{"g":"to be allowed"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to advise"}]}]}